    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11253" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cŏrōnŭla</span></b> ,
		ae, f.
		dim.
		corona, II. D.. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>The ornament on a mitre</i>, <i><span class="en">Vulg. Exod.
				39, 26</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>The rim</i> or <i>border of the base
				of a laver</i>, <i><span class="en">Vulg. 3</span></i>, Reg. 7,
			29.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>III.</b>
			<i>A little crown above the horse's hoof</i>,
					<i><span class="en">Veg. Art. Vet. 3, 55,
		2</span></i>.</div>
